DO NOT START A NEW SERVER!
- vite server is avaliable and already running at http://localhost:8888/
- DO NOT start a new server.
- you have to wait a few seconds if using playwright for it to load
- always close playwright browser and restart

- don't implement things you weren't asked to implement.

- don't test playwright just for fun, make sure you are trying to get somerhing useful out of it.
- justify WHY you are using it
- After using a tool, explicitly state what you learned

# playwright
- Whenever playwright is mention is refers to the playwright mcp tool that's built in. Do not manually install playwright from npm as it is already avaliable as playwright mcp server.
- always wait a few seconds for the page to load
- if youre going to use playwright use dom analysis or check console logs to actually find out whats wrong.

## Troubleshooting
- If you hit an issue where you say "it looks like x isn't working..." or similar DO NOT say "I'll take an alternate approach..." or similar. Continue trying at least 5 times to solve the root cause of the issue. Use Perplexity (1st) to research or Playwright (2nd) to debug or regular internet search (3rd).


